{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oIN3Ss9uab1795818217.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：乾燥的東北季候風正為華南帶來晴朗的天氣。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：天晴。日間非常乾燥，市區最高氣溫約26度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來兩三日大致天晴。明日風勢頗大。下週中後期日間相當溫暖。</p><p></p><p>06:00 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:54:53.748895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:57.202734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T22:47:57.515392+00:00","content_hash":"e1135dc14fe22ec7f55e040d830392ee37d94165b6e89d4958b116b7447a4ce8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:54:53.748895+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}